---
import SectionTitle from "./SectionTitle.astro";
import SurveyLink from "./SurveyLink.astro";
---

<section class="px-6 pt-20 pb-4">
  <SectionTitle en="Cuisine" ja="お料理" />

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 flex justify-center text-deep-red" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg
      class="h-12 w-12"
      viewBox="0 0 48 48"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="1.3"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <circle cx="24" cy="25" r="11"></circle>
      <circle cx="24" cy="25" r="7"></circle>
      <path d="M7 10v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2v19M9 10v7M11 10v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2"></path>
      <path d="M41 38V10c-3 2-4 6-4 12h4"></path>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-sm text-center text-sm leading-loose tracking-wider text-ink">
    皆さまに楽しんでいただけるよう<br />二人で考えて料理を選びました
  </p>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-sm text-center text-sm leading-loose tracking-wider text-ink">
    食物アレルギーのある方には<br />個別に対応いたしますので<br />アンケートにてお知らせください
  </p>

  <SurveyLink />
</section>
